BirdRoost taxonomy data
======================

Species taxonomy and Chinese/English/vernacular names are derived from the
IOC World Bird List v15.2 multilingual list:
  https://www.worldbirdnames.org/new/ioc-lists/master-list-2/
  https://worldbirdnames.org/Multiling%20IOC%2015.2.xlsx

IOC World Bird List v15.2 by Frank Gill, David Donsker & Pamela Rasmussen (Eds)
is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported License:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Chinese names in the IOC multilingual list credit Zheng Guangmei (Ed.),
A Checklist on the Classification and Distribution of the Birds of the World
(Second Edition), Science Press, and the China Bird Report checklist.
The generated alias table only normalizes spelling variants for local lookup.
